---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { publishedPosts } from '../../lib/posts';
import PostRow from '../../components/PostRow.astro';
const posts = await publishedPosts();
---
<Base title="文章">
  <section class="writing-feed" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
    <header class="feed-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE NOTEBOOK</p><h1 id="writing-title">探索与实践</h1><p>关于 AI、教育与创作的记录。沿着时间，留下学习、实践与思考的线索。</p><span class="feed-count">{posts.length} 篇公开文章 · 按发布时间倒序</span></header>
    {posts.length ? <div class="chronological-posts">{posts.map(post => <PostRow post={post} />)}</div> : <div class="feed-empty"><span class="empty-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>第一篇，正在酝酿。</h2><p>文章发布后会按时间出现在这里。<br />先从一个值得认真回答的问题开始。</p><a href="/">回到首页 →</a></div>}
    {posts.length > 0 && <p class="feed-end">已经读到这里的第一篇了。</p>}
  </section>
</Base>
